  "content_type": "概念解释",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "先贤以武曲七杀会擎羊谈因财持刀，并举酉宫遇庚流年流羊同度；作者解释武曲多煞少吉或无吉时负性显，七杀加重，火星与武曲化忌可不利财、人际及健康。仅保古赋与作者条件性说法，不当作必然暴力或医学判断。",
  "summary_en": "An inherited verse links Wu Qu and Qi Sha meeting Qing Yang with financial conflict and weapon imagery, including a You placement meeting the annual Yang in a Geng year. The author stresses many malefics with little or no benefic support: Qi Sha intensifies Wu Qu’s adverse financial tendencies, while Huo Xing and Wu Qu Hua Ji may affect relationships and health. These are attributed, conditional astrological claims, not predictions of inevitable violence or medical diagnoses.",
